  incomplete facts [US-BLOCKED]: first-action latency unavailable: missing dispatch or first-action observation; dispatch-to-merge lead unavailable: missing dispatch or recorded main merge evidence; PR/CI tail unavailable: missing PR-open and CI-or-main observation; reconciliation lag unavailable: missing main merge or reconciliation observation; recorded main merge evidence unavailable; attestation state unavailable
