  incomplete facts [US-HANDOFF]: queue wait unavailable: missing ranked-ready or dispatch observation; first-action latency unavailable: missing dispatch or first-action observation; dispatch-to-merge lead unavailable: missing dispatch or recorded main merge evidence; PR/CI tail unavailable: missing PR-open and CI-or-main observation; reconciliation lag unavailable: missing main merge or reconciliation observation; recorded main merge evidence unavailable; attestation state unavailable; handoff_ready observed: not a main merge, attestation verdict, or Delivered claim
